      "description": "Hi, we're Zable. Download our app to join over 2 million customers taking control of their finances.\n\nRated 'Excellent' On TrustPilot:\n\n• Quick eligibility check: it won't affect your credit score\n\n• Apply in minutes: simple, straightforward, paperless card and loan applications\n\n• Manage your money: credit card transactions, loan payments, and credit score\n\n• Repay card in minutes: make card payments in the app\n\n• Apple Pay: most approved customers are eligible for a virtual card right away\n\n• Credit score: see your Equifax score\n\n• Credit that grows with you: we automatically review your account for credit limit increases and let you know when you're eligible \n\n• No hidden card fees: at home or abroad\n\n• Simple to use: manage your card or loan in the app\n\nZable credit card:\n\nTrack your credit, spending, score, and payments all in one place on our simple, easy-to-use app. Zable cards are available with Apple Pay, and most approved customers can start spending right away.\n\nZable loan:\n\nThe loan application process is paperless and fast – you could receive your loan in under an hour. You can customise your loan amount and term, providing flexibility and control over your loan.\n\nZable Switch & Save:\n\nPay less on your car finance by switching your car loan or breaking up your balloon payment. Keep your car and check your offer with no impact to your credit score.\n\nZable+ Credit Card: Representative 29.9% APR (variable). Subject to eligibility.\n\nZable Loan: Representative 24.6% APR (fixed)\n\nWe're authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority as Lendable Ltd with reference 720261. Zable is a trading name of Lendable Ltd. The Zable credit card is issued by TPL pursuant to licence by Mastercard Intl. Credit limit increases are subject to responsible use.\n\nHere to help:\n\nReach our customer service team 7 days a week via the Zable app.",
